 Simple CNN for MNIST - PyTorch

A lightweight Convolutional Neural Network built from scratch to classify handwritten digits from the MNIST dataset.

Key Highlights:
 `Accuracy`: ~98%+ in just 3 epochs
 `Framework`: PyTorch + Torchvision  
`Architecture`: 2 Conv Layers, 2 MaxPool, 2 FC Layers
 `Features`: GPU support, Auto data download, Model saving
